{"s":66,"v":[{"t":"O Prophet, why do you prohibit [yourself from] what Allāh has made lawful for you, seeking the approval of your wives? And Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلنَّبِىُّ","Prophet","l-nabiyu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّبِىُّ",169]]],["لِمَ","Why (do)","lima","",[["لِ",8],["مَ",12]]],["تُحَرِّمُ","you prohibit","tuḥarrimu",""],["مَآ","what","mā",""],["أَحَلَّ","has made lawful","aḥalla",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["لَكَ","for you","laka","ۖ",[["لَ",8],["كَ",18]]],["تَبْتَغِى","seeking","tabtaghī",""],["مَرْضَاتَ","(to) please","marḍāta",""],["أَزْوَٰجِكَ","your wives","azwājika","ۚ",[["أَزْوَٰجِ",165],["كَ",18]]],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["غَفُورٌۭ","(is) Oft-Forgiving","ghafūrun",""],["رَّحِيمٌۭ","Most Merciful","raḥīmun",""]]},{"t":"Allāh has already ordained for you [Muslims] the dissolution of your oaths. And Allāh is your protector, and He is the Knowing, the Wise.","w":[["قَدْ","Indeed","qad",""],["فَرَضَ","has ordained","faraḍa",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["لَكُمْ","for you","lakum","",[["لَ",8],["كُمْ",4]]],["تَحِلَّةَ","(the) dissolution","taḥillata",""],["أَيْمَـٰنِكُمْ","(of) your oaths","aymānikum","ۚ",[["أَيْمَـٰنِ",193],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["مَوْلَىٰكُمْ","(is) your Protector","mawlākum","ۖ",[["مَوْلَىٰ",553],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَهُوَ","and He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["ٱلْعَلِيمُ","(is) the All-Knower","l-ʿalīmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَلِيمُ",85]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise","l-ḥakīmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمُ",133]]]]},{"t":"And [remember] when the Prophet confided to one of his wives a statement; and when she informed [another] of it and Allāh showed it to him, he made known part of it and ignored a part. And when he informed her about it, she said, \"Who told you this?\" He said, \"I was informed by the Knowing, the Aware.\"","w":[["وَإِذْ","And when","wa-idh","",[["وَ",1],["إِذْ",50]]],["أَسَرَّ","confided","asarra",""],["ٱلنَّبِىُّ","the Prophet","l-nabiyu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّبِىُّ",169]]],["إِلَىٰ","to","ilā",""],["بَعْضِ","one","baʿḍi",""],["أَزْوَٰجِهِۦ","(of) his wives","azwājihi","",[["أَزْوَٰجِ",165],["هِۦ",5]]],["حَدِيثًۭا","a statement","ḥadīthan",""],["فَلَمَّا","and when","falammā","",[["فَ",7],["لَمَّا",90]]],["نَبَّأَتْ","she informed","nabba-at",""],["بِهِۦ","about it","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَأَظْهَرَهُ","and made it apparent","wa-aẓharahu","",[["وَ",1],["أَظْهَرَ",946],["هُ",5]]],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["عَلَيْهِ","to him","ʿalayhi","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِ",5]]],["عَرَّفَ","he made known","ʿarrafa",""],["بَعْضَهُۥ","a part of it","baʿḍahu","",[["بَعْضَ",86],["هُۥ",5]]],["وَأَعْرَضَ","and avoided","wa-aʿraḍa","",[["وَ",1],["أَعْرَضَ",360]]],["عَنۢ","[of]","ʿan",""],["بَعْضٍۢ","a part","baʿḍin","ۖ"],["فَلَمَّا","Then when","falammā","",[["فَ",7],["لَمَّا",90]]],["نَبَّأَهَا","he informed her","nabba-ahā","",[["نَبَّأَ",265],["هَا",22]]],["بِهِۦ","about it","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["قَالَتْ","she said","qālat",""],["مَنْ","Who","man",""],["أَنۢبَأَكَ","informed you","anba-aka","",[["أَنۢبَأَ",1466],["كَ",18]]],["هَـٰذَا","this","hādhā","ۖ",[["هَ",0],["ـٰذَا",69]]],["قَالَ","He said","qāla",""],["نَبَّأَنِىَ","Has informed me","nabba-aniya","",[["نَبَّأَ",265],["نِىَ",20]]],["ٱلْعَلِيمُ","the All-Knower","l-ʿalīmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَلِيمُ",85]]],["ٱلْخَبِيرُ","the All-Aware","l-khabīru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["خَبِيرُ",268]]]]},{"t":"If you two [wives] repent to Allāh, [it is best], for your hearts have deviated. But if you cooperate against him - then indeed Allāh is his protector, and Gabriel and the righteous of the believers and the angels, moreover, are [his] assistants.","w":[["إِن","If","in",""],["تَتُوبَآ","you both turn","tatūbā","",[["تَتُوبَ",198],["آ",110]]],["إِلَى","to","ilā",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["فَقَدْ","so indeed","faqad","",[["فَ",7],["قَدْ",37]]],["صَغَتْ","(are) inclined","ṣaghat",""],["قُلُوبُكُمَا","your hearts","qulūbukumā","ۖ",[["قُلُوبُ",104],["كُمَا",110]]],["وَإِن","but if","wa-in","",[["وَ",1],["إِن",27]]],["تَظَـٰهَرَا","you backup each other","taẓāharā","",[["تَظَـٰهَرَ",2261],["ا",110]]],["عَلَيْهِ","against him","ʿalayhi","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِ",5]]],["فَإِنَّ","then indeed","fa-inna","",[["فَ",7],["إِنَّ",15]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["مَوْلَىٰهُ","(is) his Protector","mawlāhu","",[["مَوْلَىٰ",553],["هُ",5]]],["وَجِبْرِيلُ","and Jibreel","wajib'rīlu","",[["وَ",1],["جِبْرِيلُ",1794]]],["وَصَـٰلِحُ","and (the) righteous","waṣāliḥu","",[["وَ",1],["صَـٰلِحُ",102]]],["ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","believers","l-mu'minīna","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُؤْمِنِينَ",70]]],["وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","and the Angels","wal-malāikatu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["مَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ",143]]],["بَعْدَ","after","baʿda",""],["ذَٰلِكَ","that","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["ظَهِيرٌ","(are his) assistants","ẓahīrun",""]]},{"t":"Perhaps his Lord, if he divorced you [all], would substitute for him wives better than you - submitting [to Allāh], believing, devoutly obedient, repentant, worshipping, and traveling - [ones] previously married and virgins.","w":[["عَسَىٰ","Perhaps","ʿasā",""],["رَبُّهُۥٓ","his Lord","rabbuhu","",[["رَبُّ",24],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["إِن","if","in",""],["طَلَّقَكُنَّ","he divorced you","ṭallaqakunna","",[["طَلَّقَ",836],["كُنَّ",384]]],["أَن","[that]","an",""],["يُبْدِلَهُۥٓ","He will substitute for him","yub'dilahu","",[["يُبْدِلَ",2085],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["أَزْوَٰجًا","wives","azwājan",""],["خَيْرًۭا","better","khayran",""],["مِّنكُنَّ","than you","minkunna","",[["مِّن",6],["كُنَّ",384]]],["مُسْلِمَـٰتٍۢ","submissive","mus'limātin",""],["مُّؤْمِنَـٰتٍۢ","faithful","mu'minātin",""],["قَـٰنِتَـٰتٍۢ","obedient","qānitātin",""],["تَـٰٓئِبَـٰتٍ","repentant","tāibātin",""],["عَـٰبِدَٰتٍۢ","who worship","ʿābidātin",""],["سَـٰٓئِحَـٰتٍۢ","who fast","sāiḥātin",""],["ثَيِّبَـٰتٍۢ","previously married","thayyibātin",""],["وَأَبْكَارًۭا","and virgins","wa-abkāran","",[["وَ",1],["أَبْكَارًۭا",1766]]]]},{"t":"O you who have believed, protect yourselves and your families from a Fire whose fuel is people and stones, over which are [appointed] angels, harsh and severe; they do not disobey Allāh in what He commands them but do what they are commanded.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(you) who","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["قُوٓا۟","Protect","qū","",[["قُ",607],["وٓا۟",4]]],["أَنفُسَكُمْ","yourselves","anfusakum","",[["أَنفُسَ",51],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَأَهْلِيكُمْ","and your families","wa-ahlīkum","",[["وَ",1],["أَهْلِي",112],["كُمْ",4]]],["نَارًۭا","(from) a Fire","nāran",""],["وَقُودُهَا","whose fuel","waqūduhā","",[["وَقُودُ",1668],["هَا",22]]],["ٱلنَّاسُ","(is) people","l-nāsu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّاسُ",67]]],["وَٱلْحِجَارَةُ","and stones","wal-ḥijāratu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["حِجَارَةُ",819]]],["عَلَيْهَا","over it","ʿalayhā","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هَا",22]]],["مَلَـٰٓئِكَةٌ","(are) Angels","malāikatun",""],["غِلَاظٌۭ","stern","ghilāẓun",""],["شِدَادٌۭ","severe","shidādun",""],["لَّا","not","lā",""],["يَعْصُونَ","they disobey","yaʿṣūna","",[["يَعْصُ",406],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["مَآ","(in) what","mā",""],["أَمَرَهُمْ","He Commands them","amarahum","",[["أَمَرَ",161],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَيَفْعَلُونَ","but they do","wayafʿalūna","",[["وَ",1],["يَفْعَلُ",141],["ونَ",3]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["يُؤْمَرُونَ","they are commanded","yu'marūna","",[["يُؤْمَرُ",161],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"O you who have disbelieved, make no excuses that Day. You will only be recompensed for what you used to do.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(you) who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["لَا","(Do) not","lā",""],["تَعْتَذِرُوا۟","make excuses","taʿtadhi